# Size of a single memory block, valid range = 01...20 (hex)
Block Size: 04
Data Content: 13 33 57 2A B4 F6 BB 0A B2 67 14 97 AD 0D AD C0 56 80 C2 A9 E2 0A 65 1E A1 1E 78 79 3D 44 F5 F8
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
